comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T18:25:53.887Z",codex-agent,"Orientation found no existing SDK-adoption item (adoption search empty; all SDK hits reviewed). Related prior SDK settings work: pm-lint-settings. Audit disposition: replace src/commands.ts refusal envelope with createPmCliExpectedError; retain src/settings.ts raw lint section read because readSettings strips extension keys and the pinned SDK exports no lossless readSettingsSection API. Required upstream capability: validated lossless extension settings-section reader. No replaced path reads history or changes corpus certification, recovery, or cursor decisions. Preserve complete-list receipts. Plan native host/no-git regression, origin/main build differential on read-only public tracker copies, behavioral revert, 100 percent coverage, npm/Bun gates and ready PR."
  "2026-10-25T18:28:38.672Z",codex-agent,"Implemented the command adapter with createPmCliExpectedError and removed the hand-built refusal receipt. Context is allowlisted to code and nextSteps; no input, filesystem errors, cause, or source data is copied. Intentional native-boundary differences: command handlers now throw PmCliError, diagnostics move from stdout to stderr, JSON uses code/detail/next_steps and native recovery guidance; human diagnostics show message/remedy. The host may echo supplied command arguments in its recovery bundle. Success receipts, domain code/message/remedy and exit 2 remain unchanged. Native adapter, registered dispatch and git-free real CLI regressions pass 3/3. Settings section read retained: missing validated lossless readSettingsSection API; readSettings alone would discard lint policy."
  "2026-10-25T18:30:08.209Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof for src/commands.ts: restored the original receipt-producing helper body and returned receipts from both command catch paths, retained new tests, rebuilt, then ran node --test test/sdk-refusals.test.ts. All 3 regressions failed (0 pass, 3 fail): adapter did not throw, registered dispatch did not reject, and real CLI lost the baseline diagnostic to read-output shaping. Restored SDK adaptation and rebuilt. No history read, integrity verification, cache, completeness certificate or cursor implementation was replaced; cache-prime/history-corruption preservation requirement is therefore not applicable to this replacement. Existing corpus certification remains unchanged."
  "2026-10-25T18:31:00.374Z",codex-agent,"Differential proof compares origin/main build 34d3ba5784e75d7d78a16b680326382511d05b73 with this build using identical pinned dependencies. Verified-public Git archives: pm-review d65d149bbcafdc11d2ef6addcfff8bf2e4f479e1 (56 items) and pm-presets 117a077df250a905d8a8f9ebee39eeeb38b4a0f4 (79 items). On read-only copies in non-git scratch directories with no git executable, 26/26 comparisons pass: 10 exact output matches including complete-list certificates and acknowledgment success; 16 explicitly expected native-error changes with identical code/message/remedy/exit tuples. Tracker byte inventories unchanged. Reproducer and case list: test/sdk-adoption-differential.ts and docs/sdk-adoption-validation.md. Pinned pm linked-test execution passes 13/13 plus typecheck/lint/build; test-result persistence is disabled by project policy, so this comment records the result."
  "2026-10-25T18:40:56.377Z",codex-agent,"Implementation and focused verification are complete for review: 13/13 focused tests, 26/26 public-corpus differential cases and 0/3 reverted versus 3/3 restored native-boundary regressions. Typecheck/lint/build and isolated-home strict health pass. The extra local full npm gate has passed duplication (0 percent, 43 sources) and docstrings (91 declarations), and is still executing the existing 500-sequence SDK repair-model regression. Push the candidate so CI can execute the required npm and Bun full gates while local property testing continues. No new SDK defect found; the lossless settings-section-reader API gap remains explicitly tracked here."
  "2026-10-25T18:43:47.420Z",codex-agent,"Local isolated-home npm run release:check passes: 121/121 unit tests, 1/1 packed npm/npx plus native Bun/bunx installation acceptance test, zero failures/skips, 100/100/100/100 coverage across all 24 required source files, 0 percent duplication across 43 sources, docstrings 91 declarations, production audit zero vulnerabilities, typecheck/lint/build/pack/changelog/publish-attestation all pass. Ready PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-lint/pull/25. Its current-head CI matrix supplies full npm gates on Node 22 and 26 plus the Bun gate on Node 26; consult the PR checks for their final receipts. Initial CI run: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-lint/actions/runs/40222432316. No release or merge authorized. CodeRabbit automatic review skipped and Sourcery review quota exhausted; neither is approval. Remaining SDK API gap: validated lossless extension settings-section reader (readSettingsSection); raw lint-section read remains required. Release claim for orchestrator verification; leave status in_progress."
